  <entry class="ThingDef" node="VFEP_Warcasket_Helmet_MechController.description" original="The Mech Master Warcasket is a specialized warcasket shell that enables the wearer to control mechanoids effectively. It is equipped with advanced technology that enhances the wearer's neural mechlink with mechanoids, providing unparalleled control over these machines on the battlefield.\n\nIn addition to its advanced control systems, the Mech Master Warcasket also features a powerful energy shield that can absorb and deflect incoming attacks, making it an excellent choice for frontline combat situations. Its integrated power systems ensure that the shield remains operational even in the most intense combat situations.">El sarcotraje mecamaestro permite controlar mecanoides de forma efectiva. Esta equipado con tecnologia avanzada que refuerza el mecaenlace neural del portador, otorgando un control preciso en combate.\n\nAdemas integra un potente escudo de energia que absorbe y desvia ataques, ideal para la primera linea. Sus sistemas de energia garantizan que el escudo se mantenga operativo incluso en combates intensos.</entry>
  <entry class="ThingDef" node="VFEP_Warcasket_Shoulders_MechController.description" original="The Mech Master Warcasket is a specialized warcasket shell that enables the wearer to control mechanoids effectively. It is equipped with advanced technology that enhances the wearer's neural mechlink with mechanoids, providing unparalleled control over these machines on the battlefield.\n\nIn addition to its advanced control systems, the Mech Master Warcasket also features a powerful energy shield that can absorb and deflect incoming attacks, making it an excellent choice for frontline combat situations. Its integrated power systems ensure that the shield remains operational even in the most intense combat situations.">El sarcotraje mecamaestro permite controlar mecanoides de forma efectiva. Esta equipado con tecnologia avanzada que refuerza el mecaenlace neural del portador, otorgando un control preciso en combate.\n\nAdemas integra un potente escudo de energia que absorbe y desvia ataques, ideal para la primera linea. Sus sistemas de energia garantizan que el escudo se mantenga operativo incluso en combates intensos.</entry>
